<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13427" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποπίπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fall off from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ πέτρης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					24.7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ τῶν φιαλέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.130
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ κολεοῦ ἀ. ὁ μύκης</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				64
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hecat.
				22
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τῶν ἵππων</span>”
				<i>slip off,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					11.21.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs., <i>fall
				off,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στιλπναὶ δ᾽ ἀπέπιπτον ἔερσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					14.351
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				557b29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>miss</i> or <i>fail in obtaining,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἐλπίδος ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					9.7.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τἀγαθοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procl.
					<u>Inst.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			; <i>fail to record, let slip,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἀναγκαιοτέρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					13.84
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>to be disappointed, fail,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.36.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>UPZ</u>
				70.27
			</span></i><span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>.</div>
